# CP3: Jubilife first arrival, the Trainers' School rival takes the parcel,
# the Pokétch campaign (three clown quizzes, yes each), the president gives the Pokétch. Yes on yes/no.
# Inputs wait on the game (`until …`, `advance text`); walks hold a
# direction `until position`, running with B held; `+N` only follows a sync point (re-timed from a
# recording with tools/replays/retime.ts). Runs headless, also started late and on other seeds, in
# tests/integration/checkpoints.rom.test.ts.
# level Piplup to 14 in the grass south of Route 202 with real wild battles, healing at Sandgem's
# Pokémon Center whenever its HP is down to half (each grind returns then; one that reached the level returns at once)
